# oracle: spheres poured onto a helix of triangles read from an STL file by fix surface/local input stl, atom_style hybrid tri sphere, flat 10.0, the helix turned about y (in.screwfeeder.local cut down, gravity 0.1 instead of 1e-5 so that the contacts act: the container STL (27178 facets, too many for the connectivity of this engine) and hertz contacts are not used; stiff hooke contacts (the example values; with k = 1.0 the engine differs from native by 4e-6 relative at step 100, see the report), 7 spheres poured (all inserted in the first run: a second run with fix pour still inserting differs, see w127gsg_tribox_stl), 1000 steps then 1000 steps of rotation)
# oracle-inputs: w151gs_surf.helix.stl
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# oracle-measured: max relative error (native fixture vs engine, scale max(1,|LAMMPS|)): thermo 1.2e-19, per-atom 2.1e-16 (measured with tests/fixtures/oracle, 2026-10-14; the kinetic energy is about 1e-4, so the scale is 1)
units           lj
atom_style      hybrid tri sphere 1
atom_modify     map array
boundary        f f f
dimension       3
comm_modify     vel yes cutoff 1.0
region          box block -2 2 -2 16 -2 7 units box
create_box      3 box
fix             1 all surface/local input stl 3 2 w151gs_surf.helix.stl flat 10.0
pair_style      hybrid granular surf/granular
pair_coeff      1 * surf/granular hooke 4000.0 100.0 tangential linear_history 1000.0 1.0 0.5 damping mass_velocity
pair_coeff      1 1 granular hooke 4000.0 100.0 tangential linear_history 1000.0 1.0 0.5 damping mass_velocity
pair_coeff      2*3 2*3 none
region          insert_region cylinder z 0 12 1.6 3 5 side in units box
group           sphere type 1
group           corkscrew molecule 2
fix             2 sphere nve/sphere
fix             3 sphere gravity 0.1 vector 0 0 -1
fix             4 sphere pour 7 1 7892374 region insert_region diam range 0.5 1.0
compute         1 all ke
timestep        0.05
thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step ke atoms c_1
thermo_modify   format float %.15g lost ignore
fix             5 corkscrew move rotate 0 0 0 0 1 0 1000 units box
run             1000
unfix           5
run             500
